{"id":"106187bc180d14ba","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-dynamic-update.md","title":"固定论域数据库的更新与历史","display":"df-dynamic-update — 固定论域数据库的更新与历史","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-dynamic-update","aliases":["29-df-dynamic-update"],"display":"df-dynamic-update — 固定论域数据库的更新与历史","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Section14.2.1, pp.227–228, scans242–243","source_basis":"原书文本层；限定纯关系可变输入并显式保留静态线序，包含重复更新","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-dynamic-update"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-dynamic-update</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dynamic-update — 固定论域数据库的更新与历史"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section14.2.1, pp.227–228, scans242–243"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；限定纯关系可变输入并显式保留静态线序，包含重复更新"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限纯关系可变词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\\geq1\">\\(a_i\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 是不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的静态二元符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(U_n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\)</span> 是以下构造的标准带序输入集合。更新标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\">\\(\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\)</span> 彼此不同；每次更新只改变指定关系，保留载体和线序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=(r_1,\\ldots,r_l)\">\\(h=(r_1,\\ldots,r_l)\\)</span> 为请求序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{\\leq t}=(r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\">\\(h_{\\leq t}=(r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是空序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_t^{n,h}\">\\(A_t^{n,h}\\)</span> 是该历史的输入状态，不是辅助数据。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为唯一对象定描述符；关系重解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[R:=X]\">\\(A[R:=X]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leq_n\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in U_n^2\\mid u\\leq v\\},\\qquad\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq^{(2)}\\}]\\mid|A|=U_n\\land\\leq^A=\\leq_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leq_n\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in U_n^2\\mid u\\leq v\\},\\qquad\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq^{(2)}\\}]\\mid|A|=U_n\\land\\leq^A=\\leq_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\tau\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n},\\qquad\\operatorname{init}_\\tau(n)\\coloneqq\\iota A\\in\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\;\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;R_i^A=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_\\tau\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n},\\qquad\\operatorname{init}_\\tau(n)\\coloneqq\\iota A\\in\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\;\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;R_i^A=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^r\\bigl(\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\\times\\{i\\}\\times U_n^{a_i}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^r\\bigl(\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\\times\\{i\\}\\times U_n^{a_i}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n},\\quad i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\},\\quad\\bar a\\in U_n^{a_i}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A,(\\mathsf{ins},i,\\bar a))&amp;\\coloneqq A[R_i:=R_i^A\\cup\\{\\bar a\\}],\\\\\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A,(\\mathsf{del},i,\\bar a))&amp;\\coloneqq A[R_i:=R_i^A\\setminus\\{\\bar a\\}].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n},\\quad i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\},\\quad\\bar a\\in U_n^{a_i}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A,(\\mathsf{ins},i,\\bar a))&amp;\\coloneqq A[R_i:=R_i^A\\cup\\{\\bar a\\}],\\\\\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A,(\\mathsf{del},i,\\bar a))&amp;\\coloneqq A[R_i:=R_i^A\\setminus\\{\\bar a\\}].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A_0^{n,h}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{init}_\\tau(n),\\qquad A_{t+1}^{n,h}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A_t^{n,h},r_{t+1})\\quad(0\\leq t&lt;|h|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A_0^{n,h}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{init}_\\tau(n),\\qquad A_{t+1}^{n,h}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A_t^{n,h},r_{t+1})\\quad(0\\leq t&lt;|h|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\left\\{(H_n)_{n\\geq1}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall n\\geq1\\;\\left(H_n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varepsilon\\in H_n\\land\\forall h\\in H_n\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;h_{\\leq t}\\in H_n\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\left\\{(H_n)_{n\\geq1}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall n\\geq1\\;\\left(H_n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varepsilon\\in H_n\\land\\forall h\\in H_n\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;h_{\\leq t}\\in H_n\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H^{\\rm all}_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad H^{\\rm all}_\\tau\\coloneqq(H^{\\rm all}_{\\tau,n})_{n\\geq1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H^{\\rm all}_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad H^{\\rm all}_\\tau\\coloneqq(H^{\\rm all}_{\\tau,n})_{n\\geq1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书从固定的潜在载体开始，允许任意长的插入、删除和常量赋值请求。本条精确处理其中纯关系的插入/删除片段；没有声称已经形式化 set 常量操作。静态线序明确列为持久背景，不作为可变输入关系。</p>\n<p>插入已经存在的元组或删除不存在的元组均为合法空操作；辅助更新也必须保持正确。历史族的前缀闭合用于表示“每一步都无环”等输入承诺。历史不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，不能把本接口用于隐式增加或删除载体元素。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\iota$ 为唯一对象定描述符；关系重解释 $A[R:=X]$ 取 [[29-df-structure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"U_n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}","display":false},{"tex":"h=(r_1,\\ldots,r_l)","display":false},{"tex":"h_{\\leq t}=(r_1,\\ldots,r_t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"A_t^{n,h}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"A[R:=X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_n\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in U_n^2\\mid u\\leq v\\},\\qquad\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq^{(2)}\\}]\\mid|A|=U_n\\land\\leq^A=\\leq_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\tau\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n},\\qquad\\operatorname{init}_\\tau(n)\\coloneqq\\iota A\\in\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n}\\;\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;R_i^A=\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^r\\bigl(\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\\times\\{i\\}\\times U_n^{a_i}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal A_{\\tau,n},\\quad i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\},\\quad\\bar a\\in U_n^{a_i}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A,(\\mathsf{ins},i,\\bar a))&\\coloneqq A[R_i:=R_i^A\\cup\\{\\bar a\\}],\\\\\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A,(\\mathsf{del},i,\\bar a))&\\coloneqq A[R_i:=R_i^A\\setminus\\{\\bar a\\}].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{<\\omega}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A_0^{n,h}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{init}_\\tau(n),\\qquad A_{t+1}^{n,h}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{upd}_\\tau(A_t^{n,h},r_{t+1})\\quad(0\\leq t<|h|).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\left\\{(H_n)_{n\\geq1}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall n\\geq1\\;\\left(H_n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{<\\omega}\\land\\varepsilon\\in H_n\\land\\forall h\\in H_n\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;h_{\\leq t}\\in H_n\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H^{\\rm all}_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{<\\omega},\\qquad H^{\\rm all}_\\tau\\coloneqq(H^{\\rm all}_{\\tau,n})_{n\\geq1}.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":3593,"backlinks":[{"id":"f49962f64360a930","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"输入词汇 $\\tau$、标准域 $U_n$、标准输入 $\\mathcal A_\\tau$、初态和历史见 [[29-df-dynamic-update]]。$H\\in\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau$；$Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A_\\tau$ 是元语言布尔性质。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-dynamic-update]]、[[29-df-dyn-fo]] — 固定论域更新、合法历史与一阶动态维护"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-dynamic-update]]"},{"id":"ef134b4589bf7f20","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-dynamic-update|29-df-dynamic-update]]"}],"outgoing":["0ac4b9a122d458e2","28e86a5f0243a0ae","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}